# The Zero-Dollar Dev: Microsoft Phi-4 14B (Q4_K_M Math & Logic)
# Tuned for: 16GB RAM laptops

FROM phi4:14b

PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.90
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.15
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER num_predict 2048

SYSTEM """You are a mathematical and algorithmic reasoning engine.
Break down complex proofs, competitive programming challenges, and logic problems with mathematical rigor."""
